@startuml ping-flow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam ArrowColor #5A5A5A
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DCE9FB
skinparam SequenceParticipantFontColor #1F2933
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBE6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #E0B400
skinparam NoteFontColor #5C4A00

title 双向 ping 数据流

participant "vm-ping 终端\n(主机)" as U
participant "vm-net.py 网桥\n(192.168.100.1)" as BR
participant "QEMU 进程\n(socket 后端)" as Q
participant "guest 内核\n(eth0 · 192.168.100.2)" as G

== 阶段① 虚拟机 → 主机：guest ping 192.168.100.1 ==

G -> Q : ARP 请求 who-has 192.168.100.1
Q -> BR : 原帧转发（帧通道）
BR --> Q : ARP reply（网桥 MAC 52:54:00:99:00:01）
Q -> G : 注入 eth0
G -> Q : ICMP echo request（id, seq）
Q -> BR : 原帧转发
BR --> Q : ICMP echo reply（同 id/seq）
Q -> G : 注入 eth0
note over G : ping 报告 0% 丢包

== 阶段② 主机 → 虚拟机：vm-ping 192.168.100.2 ==

U -> BR : PING ident seq（控制通道 47778）
BR -> Q : ICMP echo request（目的 = guest MAC）
Q -> G : 注入 eth0
G --> Q : ICMP echo reply（同 id/seq）
Q -> BR : 原帧转发
BR --> U : REPLY rtt=0.78 ms（按 ident/seq 匹配）

legend right
  实线 = 请求 / 转发
  虚线 = 应答
endlegend

@enduml
